<v Daniel D. Portado>[SPEAKING SPANISH]
<v Daniel D. Portado>[西班牙语演讲]

00:45:37.510 --> 00:45:41.340
<v Rudy Rico>Now, it's time to pick the fruit and make me rich.
<v Rudy Rico>现在，是时候去采摘水果并让我变富了。

00:45:41.340 --> 00:45:43.960
<v Daniel D. Portado>[SPEAKING SPANISH]
<v Daniel D. Portado>[西班牙语演讲]

00:45:43.960 --> 00:45:47.210
<v Rudy Rico>Give me the keys to your Volvo, gringo.
<v Rudy Rico>把你的沃尔沃车钥匙给我，老美。

00:45:47.210 --> 00:45:48.700
<v Daniel D. Portado>[SPEAKING SPANISH]
<v Daniel D. Portado>[西班牙语演讲]

00:45:48.700 --> 00:45:50.880
<v Rudy Rico>Hey, stupid gringo.
<v Rudy Rico>嘿，蠢老美。

00:45:50.880 --> 00:45:53.450
<v Daniel D. Portado>[SPEAKING SPANISH]
<v Daniel D. Portado>[西班牙语演讲]

00:45:53.450 --> 00:45:55.030
